[1;33m[WARN][0m   Review: changes_requested (9 issue(s)) — The implementation partially addresses the prescribed root cause — ContentstackProvider correctly switches from useMemo to useState and adds an updateContent callback. However, the change is blocked by three critical gaps: (1) the Contentstack SDK options object in src/services/contentstack.ts has no `live_preview` configuration, so Stack.livePreview will be undefined and the onEntryChange subscription will never fire; (2) no includeDraft flag is propagated through the service layer interfaces or functions, so draft content can never be fetched even if the preview callback worked; (3) zero unit tests exist for any of the new functionality. Additionally, the changes to ContentstackLink.tsx and contentCard.ts add scope beyond the prescribed minimal fix without addressing the core live preview mechanism. The implementation cannot meet any of the six verification criteria in its current state.

